<svelte:head><title>Privacy | xmincing</title></svelte:head><section><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Song rooms contain the occasion, recipient, display names and text submitted by participants. AI providers process those details to create the song and cover. Stripe handles payment information.</p><p>Room links provide access to the room. Share invitation links only with people you trust, and keep your host link private. Rooms and generated files are scheduled for deletion after seven days.</p><p>The earlier trailer feature may retain data under its existing retention settings.</p></section><style>section{max-width:700px;margin:70px auto;line-height:1.7}h1{font-size:3rem}</style>